   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "intro",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Scenario: Product Management System\n",
    "\n",
    "Building a system to track products in a store with pricing and discounts"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "41d8f693",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "The price of iPhone is 10000\n",
      "The price of Samsung is 100000\n",
      "The price of Infinix is 20000\n",
      "Total products in store: 3\n",
      "Price after 10% discount is 18000.0\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "class Product:\n",
    "    count = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "    def __init__(self, name, price):\n",
    "        self.name = name\n",
    "        self.price = price\n",
    "        Product.count += 1\n",
    "\n",
    "    def get_information(self):\n",
    "        print(f\"The price of {self.name} is {self.price}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    @classmethod\n",
    "    def track_objects(cls):\n",
    "        print(f\"Total products in store: {cls.count}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    @staticmethod\n",
    "    def discount_calculate(price, discount):\n",
    "        final_price = price - (price * discount / 100)\n",
    "        print(f\"Price after {discount}% discount is {final_price}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "p1 = Product(\"iPhone\", 10000)\n",
    "p1.get_information()\n",
    "\n",
    "p2 = Product(\"Samsung\", 100000)\n",
    "p2.get_information()\n",
    "\n",
    "p3 = Product(\"Infinix\", 20000)\n",
    "p3.get_information()\n",
    "\n",
    "Product.track_objects()\n",
    "p3.discount_calculate(20000, 10)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "encapsulation",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Encapsulation (Data Hiding)\n",
    "\n",
    "Encapsulation is bundling data and methods into a single unit while hiding internal details.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Types of Attributes:**\n",
    "- Public: `self.attribute`\n",
    "- Private: `self.__attribute` (name mangling)\n",
    "- Protected: `self._attribute`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "7ec78f02",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "abidkhan 20000\n",
      "abidkhan 600000\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "class BankAccount:\n",
    "    def __init__(self, name, balance):\n",
    "        self.name = name\n",
    "        self.__balance = balance  # Private attribute\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def get_balance(self):\n",
    "        return self.__balance\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def set_balance(self, new_balance):\n",
    "        if new_balance > 0:\n",
    "            self.__balance = new_balance\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            print(\"Balance must be positive!\")\n",
    "\n",
    "account1 = BankAccount(\"abidkhan\", 20000)\n",
    "print(account1.name, account1.get_balance())\n",
    "account1.set_balance(600000)\n",
    "print(account1.name, account1.get_balance())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "inheritance",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Inheritance\n",
    "\n",
    "Inheritance allows a child class to inherit properties and methods from a parent class.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Parent Class:** Base class with common properties\n",
    "**Child Class:** Derived class that inherits from parent"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "20203f1c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Student Name: Abid\n",
      "Roll Number: 236159\n",
      "Marks: 90\n",
      "Total Students: 1\n",
      "Student Name: Abid\n",
      "Roll Number: 236159\n",
      "Marks: 87\n",
      "Total Students: 1\n",
      "Student Name: abbas\n",
      "Roll Number: 236242\n",
      "Marks: 86\n",
      "Total Students: 2\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "class StudentManagementSystem:\n",
    "    student_count = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "    def __init__(self, name, roll_number, marks):\n",
    "        self.name = name\n",
    "        self.roll_number = roll_number\n",
    "        self.__marks = marks\n",
    "        StudentManagementSystem.student_count += 1\n",
    "\n",
    "    def get_information(self):\n",
    "        return (\n",
    "            f\"Student Name: {self.name}\\n\"\n",
    "            f\"Roll Number: {self.roll_number}\\n\"\n",
    "            f\"Marks: {self.__marks}\\n\"\n",
    "            f\"Total Students: {StudentManagementSystem.student_count}\"\n",
    "        )\n",
    "\n",
    "    def set_marks(self, new_marks):\n",
    "        if 0 <= new_marks <= 100:\n",
    "            self.__marks = new_marks\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            print(\"Invalid Marks\")\n",
    "\n",
    "s1 = StudentManagementSystem(\"Abid\", 236159, 90)\n",
    "print(s1.get_information())\n",
    "s1.set_marks(87)\n",
    "print(s1.get_information())\n",
    "\n",
    "s2 = StudentManagementSystem(\"abbas\", 236242, 86)\n",
    "print(s2.get_information())"
   ]
  },
